<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260815T013322" id="917eccdd-8c36-4570-bf29-940ff9b09e38"/>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c0b5089-a2ad-4a1d-a0c2-49b64a0ed840">
      <Text>DEFENDERS OF CAT ISLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af66163a-cf0a-48f6-b327-1304620c3abd">
      <Text>"The Savannah Rubies"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08ce0b26-c02a-478c-9c9f-2d5ab500ab11">
      <Text>Animated Pilot </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f71bae70-623d-44b6-94b5-062a153970bc">
      <Text>Based on the original story by Talia Migliaccio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b41b7d37-de32-4a49-8b18-d4c702c36ceb"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50049139-4316-4112-9f61-e6fd79a72a44">
      <Text>TEASER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9ed9974c-9474-4cab-8372-45323e5be0ee">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. CAT ISLAND - MORNING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cb68a84-6126-43b0-893e-d97a97ece888">
      <Text>A sunlit island rises from a sparkling blue sea. White stone paths curve between fish-shaped weather vanes, flowering rooftops, and tiny windmills that turn with soft PURRS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="054f863b-de1a-4ac7-aaa6-c4af9bc6cf0e">
      <Text>Cats of every color begin their day. A baker slides moon-shaped rolls from an oven. A kitten mail carrier pedals a bicycle with wings. In the distance, a grand building gleams: THE CAT ISLAND </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MEWSEUM</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a2085eb-6a9c-470f-9fcc-c6877fcf1d70">
      <Text>A breeze passes through tall grass. For one quiet moment, the whole island seems to breathe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="062acb54-f911-4043-9a4c-cc419e417ba6">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="841389d5-f72d-4e2d-9dc8-0956e7b3b629"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="eb05de65-110a-49b3-a18b-96336cbea26c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fcba5f00-4edb-48b5-81da-a8d9380454bd"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PURREDIDENT MEW">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="e81c9a78-8573-4b6e-aced-4d3e395428fa"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1e41c280-7f96-41db-bb7a-19f0dbd626c0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. DEFENDERS' PRACTICE HILL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="887fd7a8-2d48-40b8-ac01-47272eeb2578">
      <Text>Four young heroes train on a grassy hill above town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="189b6858-a224-4513-9caa-f59c5656ebbd">
      <Text>STARGAZER, a graceful serval with star-bright spots, shakes her coat. Tiny silver moons and sharp little stars spin into the air and stick neatly into a wooden target.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7858dcd0-a48d-449d-a0af-cb2d36842133">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="535fc860-12bf-4a65-921f-619cdba95ff6">
      <Text>Three stars. One moon. No splinters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6db4c18-1929-419c-b859-63defa834e1c">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY, a sleek Siamese, disappears. Only his nervous tail tip remains visible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bf9ceda-5ba2-4ded-ace3-6dc4eb8939e7">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05b2be48-5c12-4008-ae9d-8477db862add">
      <Text>Your tail is still here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ca5d084-d52a-48a0-bf4f-dab2d1b99fa1">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b16538ca-32f6-41a8-8ba8-988f582f9e56">
      <Text>It is keeping watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24c3eddb-5dcd-4c9a-a9e4-f58c77bd2492">
      <Text>BEAM, a black cat with bright gold eyes, squints carefully. A thin beam of light slices an apple in half. The halves land in a picnic basket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba857c2b-40e8-4f94-a3a2-66a558013b85">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fddd10d9-2b95-46d8-932a-ea5cc539e8b0">
      <Text>Precision. Power is easy. Precision is heroic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bca082ec-886c-4391-a6ee-a6f8ff596f5e">
      <Text>LIGHTENING, a calico blur, rockets around the hill so fast the grass bends behind him. He stops with a proud grin and a dandelion stuck to his nose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f2c2626-0591-4e16-b428-0e3776d6e7c5">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ff59557-fae9-435e-8a77-0d94f308b9f8">
      <Text>Did anyone see that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0592c57-415b-476e-bf00-e0ba567a1da4">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9b6e55e-c168-4f12-ae34-3f1f29be623e">
      <Text>Only the dandelion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f1fb6b2-6ea8-48e9-86a0-aefa9c9f5a6e">
      <Text>From inside their little blue mission phone comes a loud, urgent sound: PROR PRR! PROR PRR!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4795c58-7e77-4dd3-aa5b-114076d06fd4">
      <Text>Everyone freezes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="76b38a18-93f2-4592-8f3c-22efdac883a6">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61f8b523-a5d6-4ec8-a5ee-1df62e847d34">
      <Text>Defenders of Cat Island.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e300f9c2-c7d3-405b-9d4e-f29681e9a77b">
      <Text>He taps the receiver. A tiny hologram appears: PURREDIDENT MEW, dignified and deeply worried.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="846883a1-b0b8-4312-89b6-c7a5d0c2e3de">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1248ef99-70b7-42ac-9e9a-be5a18579da7">
      <Text>Defenders, we have a terrible problem. The Savannah Rubies were stolen from the Mewseum last night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57c7659c-5cea-4401-8648-467cb6b57cf9">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06680c90-be93-484a-87e8-c3764af68bb8">
      <Text>The real Savannah Rubies? The ones guarded by the sneeze-proof glass?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1bfc4b6a-76c8-4f92-856e-f7c5fce3970c">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a662f11a-78c3-4ada-a5bc-adfe481b9c65">
      <Text>The very same. Can you get them back?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa39ca0a-7348-41bc-adf5-6dac0fabe60a">
      <Text>The four friends exchange a look. The breeze lifts Stargazer's fur. Her spots glimmer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a63ecc5-0bc8-45c3-9c15-f24ac0de7f65">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eab6ecbe-12ab-4d50-a3e7-d09f6116a80d">
      <Text>We will try our hardest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8bded04-8fd8-4c8d-ba5e-bf7e75169fcb">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6284a739-01f6-4ee6-8e30-81320b3d5679">
      <Text>We're already on our way!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2c2c699-7a14-435b-a5a4-5dc506815e92">
      <Text>Lightening zips off, realizes no one followed, and zips back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="462eba8f-ebd6-4076-b986-dca11dbdf977">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19a55275-90b1-40b4-a488-0dc81872cfa1">
      <Text>Team on our way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="6171f6b3-7b2d-490b-95db-659c703585fb">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d8e7f6dd-37d8-42fe-a36a-44fcc5d093f8">
      <Text>ACT ONE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3dd99d29-1b84-463d-a232-6fa872e3daac">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6eda98ed-c191-4092-a128-1f958e4a1fa0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="51f11354-628b-4fee-8966-943b920eb3b7"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ef84910a-a13d-44fb-8f58-6e426586569c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PURREDIDENT MEW">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4bcf6f8f-3839-4e77-90ee-4a096b61da9c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="bceea4ce-6d50-4e6c-99ce-050647d0ad86"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CAT ISLAND MEWSEUM - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57f8cfab-3966-40ae-8530-f277098fd7a1">
      <Text>The Mewseum is hushed and bright. Fossil fish hang from the ceiling. Ancient bowls sit in velvet cases. A banner reads: TREASURES OF THE SAVANNAH.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c537a3a3-6943-455d-b995-49e8d8ef99ec">
      <Text>At the center: an empty pedestal. Broken moon-pale glass sparkles on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf6bea8e-32e0-4ccf-bf82-5d3902abc51c">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a8f0bed-8ceb-4595-9de7-31c9c4db6452">
      <Text>The thief came after midnight. No guard heard a thing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bca2851a-d13d-496a-a39d-2e5ed2226163">
      <Text>Stargazer lowers her nose to the floor. Invisibility fades almost completely, moving around the empty case. Beam studies the glass. Lightening runs a quick circle and returns holding a snack wrapper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c28e4666-8894-4ce5-ad94-a891370482e0">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74e29924-4c43-41a7-b403-a4478f6fa01d">
      <Text>No paw prints inside the case.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3a156b2-7f84-4dbb-946c-d88d3e2483c5">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="620f4789-f861-4126-84d0-01f3e47ea706">
      <Text>The glass was opened, not smashed. Whoever did this wanted everyone to think it was a smash-and-grab.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="deeda625-0789-43b4-bf16-84c14abc4792">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f764be8a-fc25-4a20-a9c9-b4a9c0283673">
      <Text>I found one thing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6fecbeaa-eead-4fe4-9ce6-50f7db0f3c88">
      <Text>He reappears, holding a single long black hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36e4fe2d-ce7e-453b-a3f8-cd3cc1eecf06">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ca1e145-2c83-46f5-b021-a3309b33368f">
      <Text>That is not cat hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8eff81c-c564-4452-90fb-d1f2de31cda3">
      <Text>The mission phone rings again: PROR PRR!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d06c5e4b-5a97-4bab-bd10-0f1e834e70e8">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efc966f3-6b18-4968-b17e-7bc398c1eab2">
      <Text>Another report. Someone wearing red gems was spotted near the beach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03216a18-5848-4972-aa2c-9aa9030172cd">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f4aeb16-f7f3-42f1-beb0-07c1b5a417c7">
      <Text>Then the thief wants to be seen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="016460d8-c487-4c27-8bb4-46039c3cded2">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d374583c-bf61-49dd-8f19-472d5e4b134f">
      <Text>Or wants us to chase the wrong thing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d3c4499b-e206-423b-893a-e1281eaff964">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8db6ee81-82ca-44dc-b8b2-d0b69c2bbc7b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3464b0df-eaaf-48e4-8672-eb7e97e570da"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="abd3a94e-be27-4ea0-9736-cfc54188c22a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6e3eb4c5-e795-4ff0-8f49-98c97704ac1e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. CAT ISLAND BEACH - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e767644-63c9-46db-936d-fc10891bb089">
      <Text>The beach is wide and golden. Pale crabs draw tidy spirals in the sand. Far out, bright fish jump like little sparks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4788ddc7-99cc-47af-adab-e6e46973d6ae">
      <Text>The Defenders search between tide pools. Lightening skids to a stop beside several clumps of long, silky black fur tangled in sea grass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83ddf27c-77fa-4721-9900-6e8d8e7385dd">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca8ac619-dda9-4896-a550-e7ff632113f1">
      <Text>Found more!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23f62b3a-d623-4f6a-ac64-ea8fd5d35cea">
      <Text>Stargazer's eyes narrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="40c7cb60-811a-48c8-8d7c-56b14c1a5deb">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20fa7c9c-b82f-4b4f-95b1-62e6a63ce004">
      <Text>Buddha.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5aa6ae0d-7ccd-4bd2-8f4a-b42100afba5c">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0840747c-abcc-4430-aa59-5748ae744838">
      <Text>Buddha the Evil Pomeranian?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1127134-f326-4ad0-8568-b3af7ffb41e1">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e30d7d62-8e3c-41e3-8ed6-20b5aec83006">
      <Text>Tiny paws. Big speeches. Terrible hiding places with excellent decorating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="061ddd19-219a-4394-950b-4b8b5ffee8c9">
      <Text>A CROW on a driftwood post coughs politely. In its beak: a scrap of paper with a mountain drawn on it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3bff9e4e-0ab3-46c5-b470-106ac589c335">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d2b94b4-7192-4a49-80b9-a9c6a16ce133">
      <Text>The snowy forest cave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed8c870a-8144-4858-b2ca-9ca57123331a">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c63ffbd-8a7a-45bf-8539-b8775878f0ec">
      <Text>That cave is dark, echoey, and extremely full of reasons not to go in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72e9a4bd-cee3-42a7-8224-78fdec3137f7">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3b9ed32-44f6-42c8-aefb-724b6c42d057">
      <Text>Then we should go together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46e82fe9-7173-4843-a522-edbb9a19b492">
      <Text>Invisibility looks at his friends, steadied by them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7726a712-aa08-4468-941b-aa629245e1f1">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5fe729dd-6be2-498c-9bd1-1fcd7225394f">
      <Text>Together is better.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="55051e58-e606-4605-a3c1-80d5a635018a">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SNOWY FOREST - LATE AFTERNOON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cbc5c04-f468-49dd-89dc-4d1d1d28d3a6">
      <Text>Snow falls softly through blue pines. The world is quiet except for the crunch of paws and the far-off chime of ice in the branches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85a300e1-2409-4f81-bd8a-5fb779c6fd90">
      <Text>Tiny footprints climb the mountainside. At the top waits a dark cave shaped like an open mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ab74afca-774d-4738-8c46-6018687dc3c6">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d04b5e05-9e90-455a-84de-cbd11d2c8d6e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUDDHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5ca2ed92-4008-4619-bc8a-87e691fb46e4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="9607cf66-c3d9-40d7-ad97-82777c5d1a65"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="665d2c39-4020-448c-91fb-ec3518147345"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. DARK CAVE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a7d30cb1-a441-45a5-aa6c-ff2c9f579a05">
      <Text>The Defenders step inside. Their breath clouds in the cold air. Strange symbols shimmer on a stone wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12f90ad0-f315-4ebb-9da1-99251044d73b">
      <Text>BUDDHA THE EVIL POMERANIAN stands before the wall, wearing a glittering red necklace. He is very small and very convinced of his own importance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="203ae66b-57b9-4ca9-9aa0-7b3b7391e679">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43ee16bf-5e5c-4599-a75e-8224ecf0980b">
      <Text>Portal, portal, shiny and grand, take me far from Cat Island!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9cc0112f-acc5-46e2-abee-281bf6049727">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbe2ee16-10ca-49ea-9d0d-191aaca894d5">
      <Text>Buddha! Step away from the magical wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="965277c1-44b8-482c-b863-ca8ae3d9898a">
      <Text>Buddha spins around, delighted to be caught dramatically.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2a94900-0689-46db-b1ec-9c571a209909">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37123954-ad59-43ed-b46c-e4e6fd91f804">
      <Text>Defenders! You found clue number one. How rude.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83e9c4e5-7869-4509-8956-89e0e751c03d">
      <Text>The stone wall opens like water. A glowing portal hums. Wind fills the cave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e8f3034-6a36-4401-af37-c3e04a89d327">
      <Text>Stargazer leaps forward. Buddha grabs the rubies. The portal pulls them both in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9693244-b7a6-4d81-8684-91656b441e18">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5526ec18-d532-4f76-b16d-6b6f516fb3d6">
      <Text>Don't let it close!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b047477f-7041-4378-9e61-e92ccda05c2f">
      <Text>She and Buddha vanish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f206cff8-630c-402f-bad5-8fee15faa88a">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99c6f16b-77c1-4e54-84a8-b36cfe065aef">
      <Text>Stargazer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bdd66c19-5c8f-4d83-9e37-9be6caf4f3ab">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="761c0f39-0fc6-4d41-9c24-370db376c9bd">
      <Text>Defenders, jump!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8065331-5b6a-4a11-958b-5ff94dab02de">
      <Text>Beam, Invisibility, and Lightening dive into the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="c86b4beb-1d56-4a9e-af68-abca481e6d17">
      <Text>END ACT ONE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ddb124b-0d1d-461d-b027-f14b6f6d57e2">
      <Text>ACT TWO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8d8dfda3-32de-4953-8319-c65b39e74334">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="474ba004-8a3a-4a2a-848b-e9f9f077b4dd"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="bef0b7cd-1b1a-42a7-bbf0-e60e0dcab9d0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="38e37cd4-915b-44b2-adc8-7068d8aed4ce"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b4485271-1d5e-4de4-859a-092e2101f089"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. STRANGE BEACH - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a76f5f38-a4c3-431a-bd99-bc727c7061c0">
      <Text>VSSSHHHH! The three Defenders tumble out of the portal and land in soft white sand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33b5e770-56e6-4f9d-8e59-0fd21390c4d5">
      <Text>This beach is not Cat Island. Giant flowers sway near the shore. In the sky, slow clouds drift in the shapes of sleeping cats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bbc62c5c-7701-46e5-856f-743b99b80036">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a7eca20-9ef6-4900-83ec-74b5ab1d6c45">
      <Text>Good news. Sand is softer than mountains.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86313ba8-dbb9-4c43-92f2-682edf0de223">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a12ac5fa-1382-4ffc-b853-64c184fa8dd6">
      <Text>Bad news. We are nowhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ca13fb4-3b64-4f40-a8f8-73458f0376ee">
      <Text>A calm gray cat in a blue vest approaches, carrying a notebook and a shell-shaped badge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ad47ae2-a761-4725-a061-9b5ab4be825e">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d9d793ee-6aba-43d9-b72a-0411565d6f30">
      <Text>You are on the South Whisker Coast. I am Ocean, Secret Cat Investigators.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1da93717-1a47-427f-a793-ab1e940180c0">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fdca4041-ff3c-473c-95f8-b880aef70ef2">
      <Text>I'm Beam. This is Lightening and Invisibility. We're the Defenders of Cat Island.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4ab6adc-2c9a-47eb-9f32-2b27b156bfa4">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b032663-4654-411c-aa0b-3827631eb15b">
      <Text>And we are missing one Defender, one evil Pomeranian, and one very important set of rubies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa3f5a0a-2fe2-4f89-a4e2-77af6f53d014">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7be00027-42f1-45ad-843e-cb4713299b1f">
      <Text>Buddha.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90b6872f-5738-4ad9-98c8-673842ffc052">
      <Text>The Defenders stare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6a3c011-68f0-4723-89e0-9983cee31e45">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa81af41-bea9-4c7c-976f-6ff7a07bb468">
      <Text>You know him?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79b50d48-2a56-4274-9ec5-dc9b9d13eb70">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5b6aca1-5995-4dc4-af5b-41e4ef3a0f09">
      <Text>Everyone in the SCI knows Buddha. He leaves fur, receipts, and speeches everywhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1e2311e3-a16f-43e5-9753-e13a4a4861d6">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FLAME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4dc6c1df-c380-4986-b088-e72c4db1614d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="be30b9e1-bfb5-4755-9315-2a3258bea190"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LUNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="19c1b9e1-7ba9-4e68-8ec5-2a473430c676"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOONBEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="40efc432-20c4-433a-9f98-7ed93d632453"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="cf4306a0-d8b8-48f0-9c6b-d05620808c2f"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SCI HEADQUARTERS - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f98186b7-17f2-4197-a67a-7ac602ef5a38">
      <Text>Ocean leads them to a hidden door in a cliff. It opens into a bright, cozy headquarters full of maps, periscopes, string boards, and tea cups.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3992dde-54d2-4880-9e50-bb1ad82082df">
      <Text>LUNA, FLAME, and MOONBEAM gather around a map dotted with silly, impossible hideouts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1d1d3ee-13d7-4caa-b812-fb1e8a35e614">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfb9629a-9c8d-4795-8929-6571dcaa93ef">
      <Text>SCI, these are the Defenders. Their friend was pulled through Buddha's portal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ebc9ef8-85ac-4870-807e-6d0ba516b642">
      <Text>LUNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ac91ae4-a08c-41e4-ac19-75020e3cbeef">
      <Text>Then we start with his nearest hideout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0378130e-0a54-49b0-80c4-4bb1fa4ac3d4">
      <Text>FLAME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcac5b73-8205-4294-930a-c80951751138">
      <Text>The Jell-O Dome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a63a8a37-d7f0-4fb0-9c68-7ec9c1d17224">
      <Text>MOONBEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5dcaabf0-3356-48d3-9e5a-c2fbd60fc498">
      <Text>Deep tropical forest. Wobbly walls. Terrible acoustics.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="761cf31d-3ede-4aae-b020-d9c9fdc0f529">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e88979d1-7243-4076-ae61-7a783558694f">
      <Text>I dislike when buildings wobble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32be10aa-f07f-4a9c-bc91-da80d426e8d9">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d930083-6f0b-4f5d-9bd0-22ce38372f32">
      <Text>Then stay close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="34a22fbe-4426-412c-a873-1cd391ad2d98">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c5d93239-3ccb-4ce2-a514-741f3c0a0127"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="141025ea-2d95-409e-a5f2-14704d1e3cb1"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. TROPICAL FOREST - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc10fd6c-9c21-4cea-911f-e505d5eb7115">
      <Text>The team rides in Ocean's BUG MOBILE, a round little vehicle with beetle wings folded against its sides. It bumps through green shadow and gold shafts of sunlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88f14751-c29e-4f60-8d1e-6f6d7c2163ae">
      <Text>Vines curl around enormous flowers. Dew drops hang like glass bells. Nobody speaks for a moment, listening to the forest creak and chirp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0eb4a73-8df5-4116-a8fb-f6bd524c7fbc">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4d18050-de8b-4b5c-b9bb-59a4888fab75">
      <Text>Stargazer would like this place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53916873-228b-47ae-87b0-8382000312a2">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30e719d4-d394-4d61-909d-a19be7763729">
      <Text>Then we bring her back so she can complain about the mosquitoes herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a2b88067-2b65-4ec8-8487-13c021e8b453">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="829b65d1-1bda-4ce4-9fc9-f47c496f1c2b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUDDHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="cc4d4bc6-187f-4c23-84c3-068bdf3344a0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FLAME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="27d1b618-13ed-45fc-a936-0df8e5f4768d"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4b434d88-dff7-40de-99f5-a4fc8ca37205"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOONBEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d6cf4c65-f900-4d17-9319-9dbc3bb7374a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="5fefa6ba-1ebb-4a49-b18a-d88f53a53ca1"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ddd6caf6-2506-4321-a8b1-07f0feb5e1d0"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. JELL-O DOME - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a2a38b4-2563-4caf-95d8-3ebfae659468">
      <Text>The Jell-O Dome sits in a clearing, shimmering red and green. It jiggles in the breeze.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d95425ac-d4c2-40bb-9d20-7a96c3b3e207">
      <Text>FLAME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="40917793-43fc-4c59-9b29-1432bcec2401">
      <Text>Quiet now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ae8ce3c-b9be-4979-89a9-3a3b8a46dc42">
      <Text>They hide behind two enormous leaves. From inside comes Buddha's voice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbf37b26-adb5-40d5-b956-3fa037b40321">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a699139e-466b-41ca-be83-75b8ca648678">
      <Text>Portal, portal, don't be late, take me to hideout number eight!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40335692-a3d4-4e4d-a390-17ae7fe1000c">
      <Text>A flash. A wobble. Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e703db51-8cab-4ede-b21c-a8ea673360eb">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4094d1e-8a4a-4ca9-b7bf-9f72e6240c92">
      <Text>Now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="001037db-c758-42ef-b473-ddbd2aab6a33">
      <Text>They rush in. The floor wiggles under them. Invisibility nearly disappears from embarrassment when he slips.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8fefd1d8-fd45-40ea-b12b-ff4bd3a1ef35">
      <Text>At the center of the dome, STARGAZER is tied with licorice-colored rope, annoyed but unharmed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63ad975b-8286-47cd-8489-650bba913c70">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5f7ae6d-42ed-4510-be00-6a55084996ed">
      <Text>Finally.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="810e31e3-58b9-4e45-b862-44af2418905a">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8167db46-5c8e-4ead-9e3e-30f383a9b82b">
      <Text>We came as fast as possible!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9708417b-6360-4769-a9c9-7de2b5e6aa82">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bfccb68c-28c7-4aba-b749-ee8d0b1b1ba4">
      <Text>You are Lightening. That sentence has limits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="950d318e-32b2-4be0-99fe-7cf6b7be6330">
      <Text>Beam carefully slices the rope with a tiny laser line.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf570cc0-aebc-4d50-b70b-9d74a152a461">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aec527a5-6615-4a53-958b-2cb0b4498c9a">
      <Text>Did Buddha say where he was going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8727fe28-884a-4daf-a5d6-80f64e710671">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6562ff0e-dd99-4711-9162-0ea8b52fcbc3">
      <Text>No. But he was proud of something red and fake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29d0b435-9c67-4f30-b1bb-8406c07bda45">
      <Text>Moonbeam lifts a sparkling red crystal from a nearby cushion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04b8eeaa-8817-4c79-9667-a391f0274cad">
      <Text>MOONBEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9c84c47-e83b-4f2e-adb7-55bdec5f8bf1">
      <Text>Not a ruby.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e36bccaf-2966-49d9-89c5-8663ba365ae1">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b780ce9-30a9-4575-a9f3-3e3d95510001">
      <Text>A decoy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9672c47f-9bfd-4d60-ab15-116c10534d39">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90b329f6-79a0-4a76-871b-8cdf19cb9aa8">
      <Text>Then we check the Chocolate Cube next.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="cb4fad13-a08a-410a-bc81-d24f64113da2">
      <Text>END ACT TWO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b515b8fd-f9ad-4bca-ad28-baf5daa78fe4">
      <Text>ACT THREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7387b03a-6d48-4d1e-9323-401cdf59fd20">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. CUBE CITY - SUNSET</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39c4294e-430a-4c7a-ae0f-23a578f583dc">
      <Text>The Bug Mobile's wings unfold. It lifts into the pink sky and glides toward Cube City, where every building is a cube: glass cubes, cheese cubes, ice cubes, and many suspicious chocolate cubes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4261a68c-101f-4301-aa79-c6ca81338c88">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="722546d5-8611-4ba2-80c0-d08bc37d20a3"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="9e30b61e-9ce6-4f23-b0e8-e31c1c5e05bd"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="185e66a1-554d-4f0c-8a74-0c720ca7f8bf"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1662630e-bc22-461b-807f-6bde761d5344"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3975f54f-87a8-40a7-9e6b-f8f15ef761a9"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CHOCOLATE CUBE - SUNSET</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f04cb814-4f74-4dd3-997f-24ec2010417d">
      <Text>The team enters a chocolate cube in the middle of a lake of cream. The walls smell delicious. Lightening licks one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b8e8a079-e0b2-4f60-9176-70fcb8cda04f">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7760aca-e9b8-43ad-a7f5-9d8af55d6db2">
      <Text>Do not eat the crime scene.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81fbc7bd-536f-486e-8d9e-eabba6dc191f">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f46220c3-fdb3-454d-8a0b-a4b6f707a873">
      <Text>Confirming it was chocolate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aeeddaed-d2fa-4938-bf48-6236383caf75">
      <Text>They find two more red crystals in a velvet box. Beside them sits a receipt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="344ee08d-e2ce-4144-bb4d-ab095954d980">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95c44323-b136-4918-bcb9-0426c046df7d">
      <Text>Buddha bought four red crystals yesterday.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2548b10-afa3-4eb3-913a-2c3bfa45b061">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aec4fb51-7358-4a9f-af1c-45dee89a267b">
      <Text>He wanted us to waste time chasing fake rubies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f95d35ac-6af3-4baa-90ef-861f401c2bf4">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f28daabe-841b-48a2-ad41-da92b41c0924">
      <Text>If two are here and one was in the Jell-O Dome, the last decoy will be at Rock Candy Palace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b6f514f6-00b1-4e24-8cde-162c3cbae557">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LUNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="f0856e51-3a4c-4870-beb0-156f8f986744"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. CRYSTAL CITY - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="789bee4a-e232-4c21-9f94-314ea7dab953">
      <Text>Crystal City glows beneath the moon. Towers of sugar crystal throw rainbows across the streets. Everyone puts on sunglasses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cb184ac-a62c-4d62-93ba-fa0d96ab0eb0">
      <Text>LUNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd3cdf36-1338-47af-9e53-ed96647da2c2">
      <Text>Beautiful. Painfully beautiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="498ad94d-9f8d-4d8f-8da1-ce63dac0d271">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="51d3d598-e6b5-45e7-85cc-8c2c1e4059ae"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="323e6faa-1e8e-42c4-baf9-3293a2c3aa2e"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="407f6ae8-04d8-466d-986d-18cc8f1ab159"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="280370d5-b9e6-4db0-b80c-e32811d1fd83"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. ROCK CANDY PALACE - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94255ef3-111a-4a5a-b3f4-421cc171609c">
      <Text>After many shining stairs, the team finds Buddha's room and the last red crystal sitting on a pillow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="755847dd-06f1-4767-8ec4-20f5ccd1f39f">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13629bd6-c546-46c4-b739-82b1113c5328">
      <Text>All the decoys are accounted for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c62e821a-2ccb-4fd9-b7af-8bdc7fcfafa7">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cddedf48-2142-4c8a-aa1d-b2b1b24a77eb">
      <Text>Which means the real rubies are wherever Buddha feels safest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="401ec333-c257-4a4b-ac04-43500e2872a1">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e39c81a-880b-49c8-ad9d-4882984a9614">
      <Text>The Aquamarine Bubble. Under the ocean.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="754a6f91-d755-49bc-9c19-e509d1dcba52">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11207433-bb7c-4107-9708-75549943d066">
      <Text>Wonderful. A building that wobbles was not enough. Now we visit a building that drowns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="08d75289-f4e9-4512-898c-f0d5e533401c">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ec18fe72-9bf0-40a1-bbfc-04b9760be6b5"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="dfe9a5b3-d40f-4782-9eb2-45cf1c0becb2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="3370066b-e680-4bfc-91ea-336d181da697"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="53be91bb-ff23-4373-87fc-dfc4755fbaa4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. JACK'S SCUBA STORE - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fcab4302-b694-4a9d-b44f-c2c1b1244908">
      <Text>A lantern glows over a seaside shop. JACK, a cheerful cat with whiskers like seaweed, waits beside two enormous bags.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f938d75-db7d-46d4-8521-214f252161b9">
      <Text>JACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8503175b-55db-4283-bb99-0a9b760ba869">
      <Text>Ocean! Scuba gear for a secret mission?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf4840a4-4cd0-4433-bf49-77c3d65691ec">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="355c76ac-36bf-4d20-9fc3-033586c9ae38">
      <Text>You did not hear that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e11af71e-0627-4b04-ae2e-f35daa74ae34">
      <Text>JACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f23d2f3-9cba-4a32-bcd9-b7c8b1256d04">
      <Text>I hear nothing professionally.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a362aeb-aae9-4585-9b71-545519dd3436">
      <Text>The team suits up. Invisibility's mask fogs immediately.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e12f7db4-f25c-4ba7-a9a1-425bc1696218">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06d97b64-5a3e-4a2a-a387-5ca72890a426">
      <Text>Stay together. If you're scared, say so.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6612f86-416f-4b77-856c-25a17ace613b">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fde215fc-934a-4a3d-adbf-27aec836f964">
      <Text>I am scared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cb7725e-1909-496e-b4a4-0f133c45f002">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f270abe-9a60-4f00-a073-c7986eb302d1">
      <Text>Good. Now we know where to stand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f48316b-835d-44cf-a155-3014fc1a8827">
      <Text>She stands beside him. He smiles, small but real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5285e418-88c0-4c1c-83f3-5ef4b2ecb2d9">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="31965162-968c-4731-a2ab-e7846d2e3077"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FLAME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="a265bd4f-33d0-4816-aab1-35f351ff2485"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b0d65723-9022-4fa2-b59e-2118f8a498ee"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="ce848989-33db-4af2-94af-4c24ec1b0d47"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. UNDERWATER - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13a22b33-9ac5-4750-892c-83acf3ae494a">
      <Text>They dive. The sea is dark blue and full of soft living light. Tiny fish lanterns drift past. A turtle the size of a table glides overhead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="26e40487-d847-4fd0-8799-6bcc177b255a">
      <Text>In the distance, hidden by coral, shines the AQUAMARINE BUBBLE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e32503a5-4de6-420a-a127-41a7f3d92ae6">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c6e0b667-e92b-45b4-a3cc-733781a617ae">
      <Text>There it is!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c01fdb57-fd68-4a05-bf68-dc373d366fe1">
      <Text>They swim close. No one is visible inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5135c10-9631-4fa4-8a8b-c660cdb58ce4">
      <Text>FLAME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61cd7c4d-0cd1-4a0d-90f1-c697eca77b5a">
      <Text>Quietly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69b904df-624c-4424-a961-79c66a19feba">
      <Text>Stargazer extends one claw and cuts a neat opening in the outer bubble. One by one, they slip inside. Beam plugs the opening. Water drains with a gentle glug-glug-glug.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e7ce371-c709-49b5-84a7-83138c67d0c9">
      <Text>A steel door blocks the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93f3326b-b4a0-4461-8216-d67f96063ea6">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cdf15f32-a27e-4b96-9028-7b05e016fc70">
      <Text>Beam?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1995607b-d311-456e-a446-f56d5ffaec7e">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed35d487-0c4e-40ed-8491-e35938b961e4">
      <Text>Precision.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1dba8c8d-3b59-4d09-90ff-66603df20611">
      <Text>His laser draws a careful glowing circle. The door piece pops free.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="37477d5f-fd03-4b3d-9382-3d527a299cb3">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUDDHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="520ebb02-67de-44c3-ab7b-a246c90028bd"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="dff0715d-d96f-4876-acee-c1278ec5be66"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOONBEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="00c305b3-3d1d-42e8-9866-d25516dc5e38"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="cf5b381b-6621-4e59-990f-84927b5acb81"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="2e745015-0c4c-4409-8e23-1c2553d5ac15"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. AQUAMARINE BUBBLE - TREASURE HALL - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66bc451b-1281-4e37-adf8-ed087d0d80e1">
      <Text>The inside is breathtaking: fish tanks, carved chairs, stolen paintings, tiny fountains, golden teapots, and a portrait labeled MEWNA LISA.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cba36a7e-7d44-430a-bebe-f036de96364e">
      <Text>MOONBEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dcc19cad-d37b-4321-aefd-d034b80f9f45">
      <Text>Buddha stole half a museum and arranged it by color.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bec6f23e-d63e-49c7-a320-a7d107f93abe">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b556a47-03b3-4bbb-a01b-7d4373e03286">
      <Text>Look! Up there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="627d17e6-ef94-472c-a12d-3dbbe830c3dd">
      <Text>A camera shaped like a puppy head swivels toward them. A little label reads PUPCAM 2000.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b0cfa3f-3ca1-40cc-8b38-8c2dbb733ad6">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9818e1b4-bdeb-4f23-b7de-a4062770dc31">
      <Text>He's watching us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bd65ac8-09fa-40fb-9f5b-ecd96905a81f">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4438db2b-10ee-41e4-a13b-9087b47f7d0b">
      <Text>Indeed I am!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25e43ccf-e2e6-4ade-ad55-9ba254ed326f">
      <Text>Buddha's voice booms from hidden speakers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90dfde32-ba5f-40fc-99b2-f7db891fd113">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d07b6899-7cb2-4c57-a7e7-903f89514ed4">
      <Text>Welcome to my impossible-to-find Aquamarine Bubble. Please admire the furniture before you fail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5aee20e9-3604-46e4-88a6-8aee590f885e">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6df408bf-8f20-43d9-99df-93c64b10be31">
      <Text>Control room. Now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="f6399801-21bd-4950-b47b-87b62033f6ac">
      <Text>END ACT THREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f93c6fa-a4e6-42cd-8d4f-d75628ba91d7">
      <Text>ACT FOUR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="93f5b2d3-8636-46f1-a261-730d927fb1b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="4aac0db4-63fb-4c96-b8a0-b6cb1af52b53"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fa1b4af3-6778-45c3-bf00-a5d9687af814"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. AQUAMARINE BUBBLE - HALLWAYS - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e33463e0-09ce-46a6-94b0-a1c47c4ebf9b">
      <Text>The heroes race through curved halls. Doors open into rooms of stolen clocks, glowing shells, and one closet full of dramatic capes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="379e5741-d31a-45a8-a23b-7c1866723f67">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12c322ce-f867-46db-9515-b9a0f3b2c90d">
      <Text>Why does he have so many capes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="628439b6-9735-43fc-b451-6b4ccc89fc3f">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b34dd8fc-e401-41a2-99c7-cf25094990c4">
      <Text>For exits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ce618ce-cf98-4fc5-a0fe-9c5590f68b5e">
      <Text>They hear chanting ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="89d9d3de-2ae4-4d97-9ad9-a6abf92448c0">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="277be2f2-0572-452e-9dda-45c0ae43832a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUDDHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="312913f8-076d-4d8a-bfe2-6bb5c51a0e43"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="398366ce-a382-4cdd-b803-dd38d3800661"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8fed8897-8d5a-43b2-86c7-a3d1d0248ebf"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="d2a25868-111b-4b31-aed7-1b9f37f1e72b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="98a442f4-cedc-40e5-9544-d4ba4d3bc902"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. AQUAMARINE BUBBLE - CONTROL ROOM - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41f8acc5-b84b-42f8-81c3-c5e562c9f92d">
      <Text>Buddha stands at a control panel beneath a swirling half-made portal. The real Savannah Rubies glow around his neck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="175ed9da-22d7-4109-ace6-a3f12fb705dd">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a541c46-1589-4129-982e-b30d9fe3ae08">
      <Text>Portal, portal, shiny and blue--</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1782cabc-e01a-43b0-adc0-daede68bfb8e">
      <Text>Stargazer flicks three sharp starbursts. They pin Buddha's cape to the wall without touching him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14cb6fee-834e-49d8-82f2-13d0e2decd6b">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0db77249-cc41-441e-af69-bb04926ccb24">
      <Text>My cape! That was my fleeing cape!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf593b69-4b59-474c-8b44-22c58a744b70">
      <Text>Invisibility vanishes. The portal lever moves mysteriously away from Buddha's paw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbba7c74-f858-4682-87a4-4d994322755e">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc214b40-6d25-4ce5-9cf5-d122cbe77249">
      <Text>This lever is keeping watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24424f13-37fa-4458-9b4c-31383eef2a7c">
      <Text>Lightening runs circles around the room, creating a harmless breeze that spins Buddha in place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52e9af3b-f0bf-4781-be78-a8b32779aa4e">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9f15413-96d6-4485-8cb7-6b3ca3b8782b">
      <Text>No more portals today!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfdea5ba-431a-4a75-ace4-6f06b6d7206e">
      <Text>Beam aims at the portal machine. He breathes once. A precise laser snips a single wire. The portal flickers out like a candle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a325f814-4881-4c76-8edd-dbe57b4460e4">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="70ff081a-adf7-4bcd-b963-3daf9dd39bbf">
      <Text>Precision.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5e8a9b3-6927-43ed-b16d-7b5935ae876f">
      <Text>Ocean and Flame cuff Buddha gently but firmly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8e7cd97-7b02-447c-a77f-244c0078ae5f">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89eff9e6-675e-4e0a-962e-fd1f03a42fd5">
      <Text>Buddha, you are under arrest for stealing the Savannah Rubies and many, many other things.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5d934c7-59a8-460c-93f4-cd3ef8a92d8c">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c508551-971a-4ded-a515-4bb1ce7133b2">
      <Text>Allegedly many things.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92da526d-c54a-4c82-81fb-366faa3a15b9">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a566db43-ca15-4c39-b4aa-5f26702d2c2f">
      <Text>Where are the rest of the treasures?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc43bf3a-9c9b-4e0f-ac61-8d0ff2b619c2">
      <Text>Buddha sighs with the deep tragedy of someone who has been caught by teamwork.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e38c08eb-155c-41f0-8672-45652ea577a4">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc2d78c3-cde2-4727-900b-3fca68e52029">
      <Text>Behind the Mewna Lisa. Combination fourteen, thirty-two, eight. But open it respectfully. It is a very nice safe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c207eff4-d6c7-43c9-b0f0-d99886ac519f">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="91532b09-be53-4daa-b716-ce63175d071a"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PURREDIDENT MEW">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="dc225e31-bca7-471c-ba24-ea53a5d24bb8"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="b0da4b71-12e0-4e99-b3c0-00765b2df900"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. AQUAMARINE BUBBLE - TREASURE HALL - LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99ec469c-5dc5-4480-b324-4fb9b5b0c110">
      <Text>The team opens the safe. Inside are the Savannah Rubies, jewels, coins, and a tiny plaque that reads PROPERTY OF SOMEONE ELSE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db4d80e8-cdb5-4b5d-898d-7af397a51313">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b491f72-abdb-47e3-a382-08aaaedfa22c">
      <Text>Defenders? Can you hear me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="424b46b8-bb74-42c6-b22f-cba88ca2ff6b">
      <Text>Purresident Mew appears on the mission phone, signal crackling underwater.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff70fc89-f533-421b-b222-bd5dddf15005">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79e39ec2-7b2b-413c-b8df-ea9b3ac0e439">
      <Text>We found the rubies, Purresident Mew.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e970c758-072a-4096-a349-36c32663c438">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cd5d9ab-1365-46e0-a167-35df7c6f3d50">
      <Text>And Stargazer?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4a3ad90-c0b0-468a-aa23-5e2ecf885215">
      <Text>Stargazer steps into view.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c51a7eb-8a19-4890-aba0-778339243a68">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e2ce10f-d205-446e-a892-615c2252c31d">
      <Text>Still pointy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="467d2f73-020c-4503-97d3-ba6ba8083b74">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fe2aacc-04a2-4968-a9fe-853f2f854172">
      <Text>Excellent news.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="13b27d27-b252-47fe-97d4-4fe4864a7560">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c5b11fbf-8e63-48e9-a4ba-6f897f0bd335"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8d52fd43-090a-4558-afac-64fa824d5de7"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUDDHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="80fd5e78-57d6-412e-b085-184bd52b44a2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FLAME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="6e70e456-7e53-4976-ae7d-a269765ba4a2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="INVISIBILITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fe685dc0-f68b-4fd4-b1c7-ad878617a70c"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIGHTENING">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="8fb56b5e-6693-4571-a275-dc0067d082f5"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOONBEAM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="c157b7ed-7881-48ba-ac19-4b4114277827"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OCEAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="fef6c0b8-fe41-44bb-b0d1-d2784b7d5f5b"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OFFICER PAWLY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="de6c7ee8-d73b-48f9-b2fe-e5aa06eee2ec"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PURREDIDENT MEW">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="1cc8aa6c-75c3-4505-b3d9-68ee532845f4"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="STARGAZER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="0d056b2f-a0af-49b8-bff7-7412b8921cb2"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SEASHORE - DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03d41ee2-c8f1-4773-ab0f-17baf54271d3">
      <Text>Morning arrives soft and pink. Police cats load waterproof sacks of recovered treasures. Buddha, in a tiny scuba suit, sulks beside Officer Pawly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6bad92cb-702a-4ad3-96ab-62233937f801">
      <Text>BUDDHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="425c6122-cba3-455a-b9b7-2f0401da79b7">
      <Text>I request a cell with tasteful curtains.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55155466-01d7-41d0-a23d-0b7e21b8ec93">
      <Text>OFFICER PAWLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="573761ba-ddc7-43cd-8e6c-f288a1a2b72f">
      <Text>You may request breakfast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01837efc-25d8-41d3-9541-8ca2a4f98a47">
      <Text>Beam and Invisibility hand over the last sack. Flame checks a list.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb6d2573-2221-41a4-b3b5-fcbe49b54f54">
      <Text>FLAME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d8106ca-b779-4ced-aa33-a457a5263fa1">
      <Text>Every stolen item accounted for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="20f504b5-be43-4b9e-a994-2c94ce940579">
      <Text>MOONBEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd780255-abef-486e-b6fc-7ffd846b49a8">
      <Text>Except the Aquamarine Bubble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6eba313d-9ed2-4553-9c40-b8fa111dc010">
      <Text>OCEAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e848da7-38ee-480b-a95b-04ae6eeaac5f">
      <Text>Actually, the police have no place to store it. They suggested it become a shared headquarters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d242ba8c-9101-479b-bca5-cde520392abc">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="edef3ae9-a8b5-4202-b7ad-990bcec673fd">
      <Text>An underwater headquarters?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81356e29-9722-419e-9d30-01920bb472f7">
      <Text>INVISIBILITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a54a9483-4503-41d4-a711-c5806487ddcc">
      <Text>With doors that do not wobble?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="551c2943-c7d4-4edd-9023-9a08d88d2254">
      <Text>STARGAZER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86d6caaf-0278-47f3-8401-88235ad69b20">
      <Text>With friends who know the way home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c17e4b38-d7dc-4640-8042-ebe8910233f7">
      <Text>The Defenders and SCI look out at the sea. Beneath the water, the Aquamarine Bubble glows like a small blue moon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0abf7ea0-c5bb-4b00-9353-ca605d0b321c">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25e87967-5993-46cd-a62c-896ea183f840">
      <Text>Then we share it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5bbda75c-4b45-4d0c-9ddb-a4f7cbf34734">
      <Text>Their mission phone rings: PROR PRR! Everyone turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d603a52-497c-476b-a235-6effa993538d">
      <Text>PURREDIDENT MEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3c4eb146-cb92-43e5-969c-50a10db2946a">
      <Text>Defenders, I am sorry to interrupt, but a very large cheese wheel has rolled into City Hall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f80258d9-d5ac-4205-98e5-81e5d842460c">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c551009-d307-4690-aa6b-dd3fbe55a3c6">
      <Text>LIGHTENING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9df2b3f6-4526-456f-8b80-5d5ff552fe30">
      <Text>That sounds urgent and delicious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3eeb78ef-5b74-41a8-992b-602263cd706a">
      <Text>BEAM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b57744a9-0f92-4782-a4a6-91a62badab14">
      <Text>Defenders of Cat Island...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf1e17c6-82d4-4a9b-9217-7238085adbd2">
      <Text>ALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="814f34e3-8a0b-478a-beb5-4b7cad1b02f9">
      <Text>On our way!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8305fc6-579f-4f17-b464-c462a5b2adb2">
      <Text>They run toward the new day as the sea shines behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="cf00cbc3-461b-4bc0-b59d-d1755345e328">
      <Text>FADE OUT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35204b41-4b61-433d-864b-16209c77480c">
      <Text>END OF PILOT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

  <Watermarking Opacity="70" Position="Diagonal Descending">
    <DynamicContent>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" id="62a10bb2-ff06-41a3-a16b-35a0719114f9"/>
